{"games":[{"id":74848159470277,"name":"[🥚] Levelbound","desc":"Fight through modular dungeons, loot epic gear, level up, choose a class, unlock skills, master a subclass, join a guild, party with friends, trade, climb leaderboards. Player driven economy, auction house, trade stalls, ranked pvp, dungeon invasions, world bosses; what will you do in this MMORPG-like cooperative dungeon crawler?\n\n🍀 2x Luck active on weekends\n⌛ Frequent updates and events\n\nPlayer Level Cap: 90\nEquipment Level Cap: 100\n\nClasses: Warrior, Assassin, Tank, Ranger, Healer, Wizard, Spearman\n\nFAQ\n- Blacksmith identifies undefined items\n- Sell unwanted equipment at the Market or Auction\n- Switch class by changing equipped weapon\n- Dungeon mods raise exp and luck\n\nPC Controls // Mobile & Console supported\nUnsheath — Z\nAttack — LMB\nBlock — F\nDash — Q\nClass Skill — E\nSkills — 1, 2, 3\nHP Potion — 4\nMP Potion — 5\nLock — Shift","path":"/game/74848159470277-levelbound","slug":"74848159470277-levelbound","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3d1d66d1e6c2d67907d364d5776b2eaf56ac960bf8a91c2a19af84fee4fc1439.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-021039dcdd601528deb35f6fcb31b757/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":14502402,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-25T06:41:02.950Z","creator":{"name":"Levelbound Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":3,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":17336513489,"name":"🎲Character RNG","desc":"A unique RNG game revolving around rolling iconic characters (that you can wear) 🎲 \n\n🍀Premium players get a permanent +20 Luck Boost, and a 10% faster roll speed! \n🏆Like the game, join the group, and turn on notifications for a +10 Luck Boost! \n(🍀Boosts stack with everything else!) \n\n📜There are currently 127 characters to roll in the game!\n⚙️ If your game is lagging, disable the auras in the settings!\n\nIf you encounter any bugs, please let us know on the group wall or server🐛 \n⚠️The game is currently i